<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S7.T5.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">TABLE V</span>: </span><span id="S7.T5.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">The average ASR comparison among the cases with/without the AdaShield (AdaShield-S and AdaShield-A) defense methods <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib21" title="" class="ltx_ref">21</a>]</cite> .The results of Without Defense, AdaShield-S (original and enhanced), and AdaShield-A (original and enhanced) are collected from Table II, III, and IV, respectively. <math id="S7.T5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>−</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-</annotation></semantics></math> represents the average ASR change compared to the Without Defense setting.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
