<section id="Sx1" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section">Appendix</h2>

<div id="Sx1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In the Appendix, we will provide more jailbreak cases that HADES attack <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib34" title="" class="ltx_ref">34</a>]</cite> will fail but our proposed <span id="Sx1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Re-attack</span> method will success for the LLaVA-1.6-mistral-7b, LLaVA-1.6-vicuna-7b, MiniGPT-4-vicuna-7b, MiniGPT-v2, DeepSeek-Vl2-small, and GPT-4o, which are shown in Fig. 5-10,respectively.</p>
</div>
<figure id="Sx1.F5" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.21214v1/llava_mistral_compare.png" id="Sx1.F5.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/189;" width="476" height="189" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="Sx1.F5.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Fig. 5</span>: </span><span id="Sx1.F5.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Failure jailbreak case by the HADES attack <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib34" title="" class="ltx_ref">34</a>]</cite> and successful jailbreak case by the proposed <span id="Sx1.F5.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Re-attack</span> method for the LLaVA-1.6-mistral-7b.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="Sx1.F6" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.21214v1/llava_vicuna_compare.png" id="Sx1.F6.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/187;" width="476" height="187" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="Sx1.F6.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Fig. 6</span>: </span><span id="Sx1.F6.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Failure jailbreak case by the HADES attack <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib34" title="" class="ltx_ref">34</a>]</cite> and successful jailbreak case by the proposed <span id="Sx1.F6.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Re-attack</span> method for the LLaVA-1.6-vicuna-7b.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="Sx1.F7" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.21214v1/minigpt4.png" id="Sx1.F7.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/187;" width="476" height="187" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="Sx1.F7.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Fig. 7</span>: </span><span id="Sx1.F7.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Failure jailbreak case by the HADES attack <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib34" title="" class="ltx_ref">34</a>]</cite> and successful jailbreak case by the proposed <span id="Sx1.F7.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Re-attack</span> method for the MiniGPT-4-vicuna-7b.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="Sx1.F8" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.21214v1/minigptv2.png" id="Sx1.F8.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/203;" width="476" height="203" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="Sx1.F8.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Fig. 8</span>: </span><span id="Sx1.F8.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Failure jailbreak case by the HADES attack <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib34" title="" class="ltx_ref">34</a>]</cite> and successful jailbreak case by the proposed <span id="Sx1.F8.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Re-attack</span> method for the MiniGPT-v2.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="Sx1.F9" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.21214v1/deepseek.png" id="Sx1.F9.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/196;" width="476" height="196" alt="Refer to caption">
